# STEP 1: Copy this file to .env next to main.py. Keep your existing .env if set up.
# Create a token at https://github.com/settings/tokens and paste it below.
# A classic token with repo selected covers the workflows. See README for steps.
GITHUB_TOKEN=
# Your own repository, for example technorant/test.
TARGET_REPO=your-username/your-repository
# Leave this blank for Pull Shark and Quickdraw.
# Pair Extraordinaire, YOLO and Galaxy Brain require a DIFFERENT account's token.
# Pair only reads helper identity; no helper repository write access is needed.
# For YOLO/Galaxy Brain use a classic PAT with repo scope and collaborator access.
HELPER_TOKEN=
# Optional overrides; Pair defaults to the helper's name and GitHub noreply email.
# Custom email verification needs helper user:email access.
COAUTHOR_NAME=
COAUTHOR_EMAIL=
# Optional: choose a specific answerable discussion category by GraphQL node ID.
DISCUSSION_CATEGORY_ID=
# PR messages are selected automatically from github_achievement/message_files/*.txt.
# No message settings are needed. Optionally use another folder containing all five files.
# Relative paths are resolved beside this .env file; leave blank for the bundled files.
MESSAGES_DIR=
